  - TextID: tutorial.step1_attack.dialogue
    Texts:
    - Language: English
      Text: 'Run out of attacks,

        and the fight is over

        -- so are
        you...'
    - Language: Spanish
      Text: "Sin ataques,\nse acaba la pelea\n-- y t\xFA tambi\xE9n..."
    - Language: Swedish
      Text: "Slut p\xE5 attacker,\noch striden \xE4r \xF6ver\n-- precis som du..."
    - Language: Danish
      Text: 
    - Language: German
      Text: 'Keine Angriffe mehr,

        der Kampf ist vorbei

        -- und du
        auch...'
    - Language: French
      Text: 'Plus d''attaques,

        le combat est fini

        -- toi aussi...'
    - Language: Portuguese (Brazil)
      Text: "Sem ataques,\na luta acaba\n-- e voc\xEA tamb\xE9m..."
  - TextID: tutorial.step1_cards.dialogue
    Texts:
    - Language: English
      Text: 'THIS IS YOUR ARMY!


        YOU DEFEAT YOUR ENEMY BY ATTACKING WITH
        UP TO 4 UNITS PER TURN'
    - Language: Spanish
      Text: "\xA1ESTE ES TU EJ\xC9RCITO!\n\nDERROTA AL ENEMIGO ATACANDO CON HASTA
        4 UNIDADES POR TURNO"
    - Language: Swedish
      Text: "DET H\xC4R \xC4R DIN ARM\xC9!\n\nBESEGRA FIENDEN GENOM ATT ATTACKERA
        MED UPP TILL 4 ENHETER PER TUR"
    - Language: Danish
      Text: 
    - Language: German
      Text: 'DAS IST DEINE ARMEE!


        BESIEGE DEN GEGNER MIT BIS ZU 4 EINHEITEN
        PRO ZUG'
    - Language: French
      Text: "VOICI TON ARM\xC9E!\n\nBATS L'ENNEMI AVEC JUSQU'\xC0 4 UNIT\xC9S PAR
        TOUR"
    - Language: Portuguese (Brazil)
      Text: "ESTE \xC9 SEU EX\xC9RCITO!\n\nDERROTE O INIMIGO ATACANDO COM AT\xC9
        4 UNIDADES POR TURNO"
  - TextID: tutorial.step1_clickroll.dialogue
    Texts:
    - Language: English
      Text: Click REROLL
    - Language: Spanish
      Text: Pulsa REROLL
    - Language: Swedish
      Text: "Klicka p\xE5 REROLL"
    - Language: Danish
      Text: 
    - Language: German
      Text: Klicke REROLL
    - Language: French
      Text: Clique REROLL
    - Language: Portuguese (Brazil)
      Text: Clique REROLL
  - TextID: tutorial.step1_combofriendly.dialogue
    Texts:
    - Language: English
      Text: 'NOW THAT''S A COMBO-FRIENDLY SET OF UNITS!


        LET''S PICK 4 FOR
        OUR NEXT ATTACK'
    - Language: Spanish
      Text: "\xA1ESO S\xCD ES UN BUEN COMBO!\n\nELIGE 4 PARA EL PR\xD3XIMO ATAQUE"
    - Language: Swedish
      Text: "NU SER DET UT SOM EN BRA COMBO!\n\nV\xC4LJ 4 TILL N\xC4STA ATTACK"
    - Language: Danish
      Text: 
    - Language: German
      Text: "DAS IST EINE GUTE COMBO!\n\nW\xC4HLE 4 F\xDCR DEN N\xC4CHSTEN ANGRIFF"
    - Language: French
      Text: "VOIL\xC0 UN BON COMBO!\n\nCHOISIS-EN 4 POUR LA PROCHAINE ATTAQUE"
    - Language: Portuguese (Brazil)
      Text: "AGORA SIM, UM BOM COMBO!\n\nESCOLHA 4 PARA O PR\xD3XIMO ATAQUE"
  - TextID: tutorial.step1_enemy.dialogue
    Texts:
    - Language: English
      Text: 'Enemies tend to strike back....


        Pro tip, Don''t die'
    - Language: Spanish
      Text: 'Los enemigos suelen contraatacar....


        Consejo: No mueras'
    - Language: Swedish
      Text: "Fiender sl\xE5r g\xE4rna tillbaka....\n\nProffstips: D\xF6 inte"
    - Language: Danish
      Text: 
    - Language: German
      Text: "Gegner schlagen gern zur\xFCck....\n\nProfi-Tipp: Nicht sterben"
    - Language: French
      Text: 'Les ennemis ripostent souvent....


        Conseil: Ne meurs pas'
    - Language: Portuguese (Brazil)
      Text: "Inimigos costumam contra-atacar....\n\nDica: N\xE3o morra"
  - TextID: tutorial.step1_gold.dialogue
    Texts:
    - Language: English
      Text: 'WELL DONE!


        YOU EARN GOLD BY DEFEATING ENEMIES'
    - Language: Spanish
      Text: "\xA1BIEN HECHO!\n\nGANAS ORO AL DERROTAR ENEMIGOS"
    - Language: Swedish
      Text: "BRA JOBBAT!\n\nDU TJ\xC4NAR GULD GENOM ATT BESEGRA FIENDER"
    - Language: Danish
      Text: 
    - Language: German
      Text: "GUT GEMACHT!\n\nF\xDCR BESIEGTE GEGNER ERH\xC4LTST DU GOLD"
    - Language: French
      Text: "BIEN JOU\xC9!\n\nTU GAGNES DE L'OR EN BATTANT DES ENNEMIS"
    - Language: Portuguese (Brazil)
      Text: "MUITO BEM!\n\nVOC\xCA GANHA OURO AO DERROTAR INIMIGOS"
  - TextID: tutorial.step1_hero.dialogue
    Texts:
    - Language: English
      Text: 'AH, WELCOME YOUNG HERO!


        LET''S GET YOU READY FOR YOUR FIRST
        BATTLE'
    - Language: Spanish
      Text: "\xA1AH, BIENVENIDO JOVEN H\xC9ROE!\n\nPREP\xC1RATE PARA TU PRIMERA BATALLA"
    - Language: Swedish
      Text: "AH, V\xC4LKOMMEN UNGA HJ\xC4LTE!\n\nL\xC5T OSS G\xD6RA DIG REDO F\xD6R
        DIN F\xD6RSTA STRID"
    - Language: Danish
      Text: 
    - Language: German
      Text: "AH, WILLKOMMEN JUNGER HELD!\n\nMACH DICH BEREIT F\xDCR DEINEN ERSTEN
        KAMPF"
    - Language: French
      Text: "AH, BIENVENUE JEUNE H\xC9ROS!\n\nPR\xC9PARE-TOI POUR TON PREMIER COMBAT"
    - Language: Portuguese (Brazil)
      Text: "AH, BEM-VINDO JOVEM HER\xD3I!\n\nPREPARE-SE PARA SUA PRIMEIRA BATALHA"
  - TextID: tutorial.step1_preattack.dialogue
    Texts:
    - Language: English
      Text: Click Attack
    - Language: Spanish
      Text: Pulsa ATACAR
    - Language: Swedish
      Text: Klicka ATTACKERA
    - Language: Danish
      Text: 
    - Language: German
      Text: Klicke ANGRIFF
    - Language: French
      Text: Clique ATTAQUER
    - Language: Portuguese (Brazil)
      Text: Clique ATACAR
  - TextID: tutorial.step1_reroll.dialogue
    Texts:
    - Language: English
      Text: No strong combos here...  Try a reroll to find cards that share the same
        race or class
    - Language: Spanish
      Text: No hay combos fuertes... Haz Reroll para buscar cartas de la misma raza
        o clase
    - Language: Swedish
      Text: "Ingen stark combo h\xE4r... Testa en reroll f\xF6r att hitta kort med
        samma ras eller klass"
    - Language: Danish
      Text: 
    - Language: German
      Text: "Keine starke Combo... Nutze Reroll f\xFCr Karten mit gleichem Volk oder
        gleicher Klasse"
    - Language: French
      Text: "Pas de bon combo... Fais un Reroll pour trouver des cartes de m\xEAme
        Race ou Classe"
    - Language: Portuguese (Brazil)
      Text: "Sem combos fortes... Use Reroll para achar cartas da mesma Ra\xE7a ou
        Classe"
