    Texts:
    - Language: English
      Text: COMBINING 4 ORC UNITS WILL MULTIPLY YOUR TOTAL DAMAGE WITH 3X
    - Language: Spanish
      Text: "4 ORCOS MULTIPLICAN TU DA\xD1O TOTAL X3"
    - Language: Swedish
      Text: 4 ORCHER GER 3X TOTAL SKADA
    - Language: Danish
      Text: 
