    - Language: Portuguese (Brazil)
      Text: 4 GUERREIROS MULTIPLICAM SEU DANO TOTAL POR 3X
  - TextID: tutorial.step2_shop.dialogue
    Texts:
    - Language: English
      Text: 'WELCOME TO THE SHOP!


        STEP INSIDE - MY WARES MIGHT JUST KEEP
        YOU ALIVE FOR ANOTHER BATTLE'
    - Language: Spanish
      Text: "\xA1BIENVENIDO A LA TIENDA!\n\nENTRA - MIS PRODUCTOS PODR\xCDAN SALVARTE
        OTRA BATALLA"
    - Language: Swedish
      Text: "V\xC4LKOMMEN TILL BUTIKEN!\n\nKLIV IN - MINA VAROR KANSKE H\xC5LLER
        DIG VID LIV EN STRID TILL"
    - Language: Danish
      Text: 
    - Language: German
      Text: "WILLKOMMEN IM SHOP!\n\nKOMM REIN - MEINE WAREN K\xD6NNTEN DICH NOCH
        EINEN KAMPF RETTEN"
    - Language: French
      Text: "BIENVENUE \xC0 LA BOUTIQUE!\n\nENTRE - MES ARTICLES POURRAIENT TE SAUVER
        UN COMBAT DE PLUS"
    - Language: Portuguese (Brazil)
      Text: "BEM-VINDO \xC0 LOJA!\n\nENTRE - MEUS ITENS PODEM TE MANTER VIVO POR
        MAIS UMA BATALHA"
  - TextID: tutorial.step2_shop2.dialogue
    Texts:
    - Language: English
      Text: Artifacts give passive bonus that will improve your deck
    - Language: Spanish
      Text: Los Artefactos dan bonus pasivos que mejoran tu Mazo
    - Language: Swedish
      Text: "Artefakter ger passiva bonusar som f\xF6rb\xE4ttrar ditt Deck"
    - Language: Danish
      Text: 
    - Language: German
      Text: Artefakte geben passive Boni und verbessern dein Deck
    - Language: French
      Text: "Les Artefacts donnent des bonus passifs qui am\xE9liorent ton Deck"
    - Language: Portuguese (Brazil)
      Text: "Artefatos d\xE3o b\xF4nus passivos que melhoram seu Deck"
  - TextID: tutorial.step2_shop3.dialogue
    Texts:
    - Language: English
      Text: 'LET''S BUY THIS ONE!


        IT GIVES YOU +20 DAMAGE EVERY TIME YOU
        ATTACK


        Drag to buy!'
    - Language: Spanish
      Text: "\xA1COMPRA ESTE!\n\nTE DA +20 DA\xD1O CADA VEZ QUE ATACAS\n\n\xA1Arrastra
        para comprar!"
    - Language: Swedish
      Text: "K\xD6P DEN H\xC4R!\n\nDEN GER +20 SKADA VARJE G\xC5NG DU ATTACKERAR\n\nDra
        f\xF6r att k\xF6pa!"
    - Language: Danish
      Text: 
    - Language: German
      Text: 'KAUF DAS!


        +20 SCHADEN BEI JEDEM ANGRIFF


        Zum Kaufen
        ziehen!'
    - Language: French
      Text: "ACH\xC8TE CELUI-CI!\n\n+20 D\xC9G\xC2TS \xC0 CHAQUE ATTAQUE\n\nGlisse
        pour acheter!"
    - Language: Portuguese (Brazil)
      Text: "COMPRE ESTE!\n\nELE D\xC1 +20 DANO A CADA ATAQUE\n\nArraste para comprar!"
  - TextID: tutorial.step2_shop4_clickbattle.dialogue
    Texts:
    - Language: English
      Text: Click to go to battle!
    - Language: Spanish
      Text: "\xA1Pulsa para ir a batalla!"
    - Language: Swedish
      Text: "Klicka f\xF6r strid!"
    - Language: Danish
      Text: 
    - Language: German
      Text: "Klicke f\xFCr den Kampf!"
    - Language: French
      Text: Clique pour combattre!
    - Language: Portuguese (Brazil)
      Text: Clique para batalhar!
  - TextID: tutorial.step2_shop4_potion.dialogue
    Texts:
    - Language: English
      Text: Potions are consumables that give units one-time bonues during battle
    - Language: Spanish
      Text: Las Pociones se consumen y dan bonus de un uso en batalla
    - Language: Swedish
      Text: "Brygder anv\xE4nds en g\xE5ng och ger enheter bonusar i strid"
    - Language: Danish
      Text: 
    - Language: German
      Text: "Tr\xE4nke sind Verbrauchsitems und geben einmalige Boni im Kampf"
    - Language: French
      Text: Les Potions sont consommables et donnent un bonus unique en combat
    - Language: Portuguese (Brazil)
      Text: "Po\xE7\xF5es s\xE3o consum\xEDveis e d\xE3o b\xF4nus de uso \xFAnico
        na batalha"
  - TextID: tutorial.step2_shop4_potion2.dialogue
    Texts:
    - Language: English
      Text: 'Just what you need!


        This potion will heal your Hero for 20%
        max health during battle


        Drag to buy'
    - Language: Spanish
      Text: "\xA1Justo lo que necesitas!\n\nEsta Poci\xF3n cura al H\xE9roe un 20%
        del HP m\xE1x.\n\nArrastra para comprar"
    - Language: Swedish
      Text: "Precis vad du beh\xF6ver!\n\nDen h\xE4r brygden l\xE4ker Hj\xE4lten
        med 20% max-HP i strid\n\nDra f\xF6r att k\xF6pa"
    - Language: Danish
      Text: 
    - Language: German
      Text: 'Genau das Richtige!


        Dieser Trank heilt 20% Max-HP im Kampf


        Zum
        Kaufen ziehen'
    - Language: French
      Text: "Parfait!\n\nCette Potion soigne 20% des PV max du H\xE9ros\n\nGlisse
        pour acheter"
    - Language: Portuguese (Brazil)
      Text: "Era o que faltava!\n\nEsta Po\xE7\xE3o cura 20% do HP m\xE1x. do Her\xF3i\n\nArraste
        para comprar"
  - TextID: tutorial.step2_shop4_potion3.dialogue
    Texts:
    - Language: English
      Text: 'Just what you need!


        This potion will heal your Hero for 20%
        max health during battle.'
    - Language: Spanish
      Text: "\xA1Justo lo que necesitas!\n\nEsta Poci\xF3n cura al H\xE9roe un 20%
        del HP m\xE1x."
    - Language: Swedish
      Text: "Precis vad du beh\xF6ver!\n\nDen h\xE4r brygden l\xE4ker Hj\xE4lten
        med 20% max-HP i strid."
    - Language: Danish
      Text: 
    - Language: German
      Text: 'Genau das Richtige!


        Dieser Trank heilt 20% Max-HP im Kampf.'
    - Language: French
      Text: "Parfait!\n\nCette Potion soigne 20% des PV max du H\xE9ros."
    - Language: Portuguese (Brazil)
      Text: "Era o que faltava!\n\nEsta Po\xE7\xE3o cura 20% do HP m\xE1x. do Her\xF3i."
  - TextID: tutorial.step3_artifact.dialogue
    Texts:
    - Language: English
      Text: YOUR ARTIFACT JUST ADDED +20 BONUS DAMAGE
    - Language: Spanish
      Text: "TU ARTEFACTO A\xD1ADI\xD3 +20 DA\xD1O EXTRA"
    - Language: Swedish
      Text: DIN ARTEFAKT LA JUST TILL +20 BONUSSKADA
    - Language: Danish
      Text: 
    - Language: German
      Text: DEIN ARTEFAKT GAB +20 BONUS-SCHADEN
    - Language: French
      Text: "TON ARTEFACT VIENT D'AJOUTER +20 D\xC9G\xC2TS"
    - Language: Portuguese (Brazil)
      Text: SEU ARTEFATO ADICIONOU +20 DANO EXTRA
  - TextID: tutorial.step3_potion.dialogue
    Texts:
    - Language: English
      Text: Drag potion on units or hero to use potions.
    - Language: Spanish
      Text: "Arrastra la Poci\xF3n a una unidad o al H\xE9roe."
    - Language: Swedish
      Text: "Dra brygden till en enhet eller Hj\xE4lten."
    - Language: Danish
      Text: 
    - Language: German
      Text: "Ziehe Tr\xE4nke auf Units oder den Helden."
    - Language: French
      Text: "Glisse une Potion sur une Unit\xE9 ou le H\xE9ros."
    - Language: Portuguese (Brazil)
      Text: "Arraste a Po\xE7\xE3o para uma Unidade ou Her\xF3i."
  - TextID: tutorial.step4_shop1.dialogue
    Texts:
    - Language: English
      Text: 'Back in one piece, I see!


        Care to upgrade your chance of staying
        that way?'
    - Language: Spanish
      Text: "\xA1Has vuelto entero!\n\n\xBFQuieres mejorar tus opciones de seguir
        as\xED?"
    - Language: Swedish
      Text: "Tillbaka i ett stycke!\n\nVill du \xF6ka chansen att f\xF6rbli s\xE5?"
    - Language: Danish
      Text: 
    - Language: German
      Text: "Noch an einem St\xFCck!\n\nWillst du deine Chancen erh\xF6hen, dass
        das so bleibt?"
    - Language: French
      Text: "Toujours entier!\n\nTu veux am\xE9liorer tes chances de le rester?"
    - Language: Portuguese (Brazil)
      Text: 'Voltou inteiro!


        Quer aumentar suas chances de continuar assim?'
  - TextID: tutorial.step4_shop2.dialogue
    Texts:
    - Language: English
      Text: Armory upgrades modify individual units in your deck to make them stronger
    - Language: Spanish
      Text: Las mejoras fortalecen unidades de tu Mazo
    - Language: Swedish
      Text: "Enhetsuppgraderingar st\xE4rker enskilda enheter i ditt Deck"
    - Language: Danish
      Text: 
    - Language: German
      Text: "Unit-Upgrades verst\xE4rken einzelne Einheiten in deinem Deck"
    - Language: French
      Text: "Les am\xE9liorations renforcent les Unit\xE9s de ton Deck"
    - Language: Portuguese (Brazil)
      Text: Melhorias fortalecem Unidades individuais do seu Deck
  - TextID: tutorial.step4_shop3.dialogue
    Texts:
    - Language: English
      Text: 'THIS IS AN ARMORY UPGRADE.


        iT WILL UPGRADE A TARGET UNIT WITH
        ADDITIONAL POWERS'
    - Language: Spanish
      Text: 'ESTO ES UNA MEJORA.


        DA PODERES EXTRA A UNA UNIDAD'
    - Language: Swedish
      Text: "DET H\xC4R \xC4R EN ENHETSUPPGRADERING.\n\nDEN GER EN VALD ENHET EXTRA
        KRAFTER"
    - Language: Danish
      Text: 
    - Language: German
      Text: "DAS IST EIN UNIT-UPGRADE.\n\nES GIBT EINER EINHEIT ZUS\xC4TZLICHE KR\xC4FTE"
    - Language: French
      Text: "C'EST UNE AM\xC9LIORATION.\n\nELLE DONNE DES POUVOIRS EN PLUS \xC0 UNE
        UNIT\xC9"
    - Language: Portuguese (Brazil)
      Text: "ESTA \xC9 UMA MELHORIA.\n\nELA D\xC1 PODERES EXTRAS A UMA UNIDADE"
  - TextID: tutorial.step5_boss1.dialogue
    Texts:
    - Language: English
      Text: 'Boss fight ahead!


        This trouble-maker has a special ability'
    - Language: Spanish
      Text: "\xA1Jefe a la vista!\n\nEste rival tiene una habilidad especial"
    - Language: Swedish
      Text: "Bossstrid framf\xF6r dig!\n\nDen h\xE4r br\xE5kmakaren har en specialf\xF6rm\xE5ga"
    - Language: Danish
      Text: 
    - Language: German
      Text: "Bosskampf voraus!\n\nDieser Gegner hat eine Spezialf\xE4higkeit"
    - Language: French
      Text: "Boss en vue!\n\nCet adversaire a une capacit\xE9 sp\xE9ciale"
    - Language: Portuguese (Brazil)
      Text: "Boss \xE0 frente!\n\nEste inimigo tem uma habilidade especial"
  - TextID: tutorial.step5_boss2.dialogue
    Texts:
    - Language: English
      Text: Two random unit races are disabled for this fight
    - Language: Spanish
      Text: Dos razas aleatorias quedan desactivadas en esta batalla
    - Language: Swedish
      Text: "Tv\xE5 slumpade raser \xE4r avst\xE4ngda i den h\xE4r striden"
    - Language: Danish
      Text: 
    - Language: German
      Text: "Zwei zuf\xE4llige V\xF6lker sind in diesem Kampf deaktiviert"
    - Language: French
      Text: "Deux Races al\xE9atoires sont d\xE9sactiv\xE9es pour ce combat"
    - Language: Portuguese (Brazil)
      Text: "Duas Ra\xE7as aleat\xF3rias ficam desativadas nesta batalha"
  - TextID: tutorial.step6_shop1.dialogue
    Texts:
    - Language: English
      Text: 'CONGRATS - YOUR FIRST BOSS VICTORY!


        i HAVE SOMETHING SPECIAL
        IN STORE TO CELEBRATE.'
    - Language: Spanish
      Text: "\xA1ENHORABUENA - TU PRIMER JEFE!\n\nTENGO ALGO ESPECIAL PARA CELEBRARLO."
    - Language: Swedish
      Text: "GRATTIS - DIN F\xD6RSTA BOSSSEGER!\n\nJAG HAR N\xC5GOT SPECIELLT \xC5T
        DIG."
    - Language: Danish
      Text: 
    - Language: German
      Text: "GL\xDCCKWUNSCH - DEIN ERSTER BOSS-SIEG!\n\nICH HABE ETWAS BESONDERES
        F\xDCR DICH."
    - Language: French
      Text: "BRAVO - TON PREMIER BOSS VAINCU!\n\nJ'AI QUELQUE CHOSE DE SP\xC9CIAL
        POUR F\xCATER \xC7A."
    - Language: Portuguese (Brazil)
      Text: "PARAB\xC9NS - SEU PRIMEIRO BOSS!\n\nTENHO ALGO ESPECIAL PARA COMEMORAR."
  - TextID: tutorial.step6_shop2.dialogue
    Texts:
    - Language: English
      Text: 'Your first Rune!


        Runes have passive bonus effects that will
        last for your entire run'
    - Language: Spanish
      Text: "\xA1Tu primera Runa!\n\nLas Runas dan bonus pasivos durante toda la
        partida"
    - Language: Swedish
      Text: "Din f\xF6rsta Runa!\n\nRunor ger passiva bonusar under hela din run"
    - Language: Danish
      Text: 
    - Language: German
